Taking Melty's hand herself, Lycoris clinging and appealing—what flows endlessly from her mouth is the untold circumstances of the "Beloved Children" who invaded this castle.

Of course, part of it is Lycoris being careless originally.

But more than that, what loosened her tongue was the fierce might of "Coaxer" wielded in a state where she'd been made to think of Melty as an ally from the start—probably, she could never cheat. She'd be found out immediately. Made to confess.

It was unmistakable proof that Melty Pristis was one of the "Beloved Children."

