Nodding, thumbs-upping, even signaling with eyes is nearly impossible, but he's witnessed the certainty of her power. Subaru also has worth in taking on the burden of "Collapse."

The rest is—

"Lycoris, actually, there's another 'Beloved Child' besides me. But we got lost in the castle and can't rendezvous, and I'm troubled."

"Eh! That means you can't meet the one you want to meet? What a tragedy... I think love grows bigger when you keep missing each other like that..."

"—But then we'd trouble Mama."

