With that, one objective of the "Natsuki Subaru Fake Murder Case" is cleared. If the "Detour" is lifted, now, the scattered, everyone, will, be safe—y.

"—Don't die, idiot!! What were you thinking, don't be ridiculous!!"

—The moment, the scruff of his dying consciousness was grabbed, forcibly pulled back to reality.

"—Ah."

"Idiot! You were about to die just now! Unbelievable, unbelievable, unbelievable! Why do such a stupid thing! Why...!"

He hears a tearful voice. A voice lamenting, shouting why, why.

He can't leave her crying. For that, he held onto life by a thread.

――――

—Instead of responding, in the corner of his vision, countless cuts ran across the ceiling, and from beyond the slashed-open white canopy, a shadow leaped into the underground. —Without a sound.
